  "semantic_contract": "Original model-view scratch reconstruction.104 stored model pointers have maximum last-vertex index47. At4AC8 the app21E cursor advances6 and clearsWORD6 once per lastindex+1 records; face selection4C56 marks BYTE6 through an original vertex-offset stream.4C9C tests BYTE6, transforms only used source vertices and stores XYZ WORDs0/2/4 into app records, advances8.4D08 reads those WORDs, writes projected XYZ/depth WORDs into separate8-byte projected scratch records, and stores outcode at sourceBYTE7 (near80; XY sidebits1/2/4/8). Model path does not initialize destination bytes6/7 here; special36-vertex path writes destinationBYTE6 and sometimes readsWORD6, so destinationtail remains generic mode-dependent flags, not universally sameoutcode. The48-record384-byte app21E prefix is justified for supplied104 headers, not full neighboringcapacity or arbitrary replacement models. Seeds describe current-record types at original loopheads, not absolute pointer/lifetime or all-entry evidence; loops retain modelcount and callerframe assumptions.5AF2 consumes combined clipmask, near bit7 forces four sidepasses, and preserves original arithmetic. No new runtime or code promotion; app scratch bytes are runtime workspace, not classified original payload bytes.",
